0005: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0006:     """Shear the rectangular input down-left onto a black canvas.
0007: 
0008:     Input structure
0009:     A rectangular grid of colored pixels with no internal empty region to infer.
0010: 
0011:     Rule
0012:     Create a black output with the same height and width W + H - 1, then copy
0013:     each input row r unchanged starting at column H - 1 - r.
0014: 
0015:     Key insight
0016:     The colors and row contents are preserved; only the row offsets change so
0017:     the left edge forms a descending diagonal.
